# The backend image is built with the repository root as its context (backend/Dockerfile). This file is an
# ALLOWLIST: everything is left out except what the image needs, so a secret or a large directory can never be sent
# to the builder or copied into an image by accident. In particular `.env` (real keys) is never in the context.
*
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/askact
# Optional: a manually downloaded copy of the Act, used if the build cannot fetch it (data/raw is gitignored, so on
# a clean clone there is none, and the build fetches the text itself).
!data/raw/*.html
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
